<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-BARCELONA V FIORENTINA TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BARCELONA V FIORENTINA TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA, Spain 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Thursday's European Cup Winners' Cup semifinal first leg between Barcelona and Fiorentina:</p>
<p>Barcelona: 1-Vitor Baia, 2-Albert Ferrer, 5-Gheorghe Popescu, 7-Luis Figo, 8-Hristo Stoichkov, 9-Ronaldo, 10-Giovanni, 18-Guillermo Amor, 20-Miguel Angel Nadal, 24-Roger Garcia, 26-Fernando Couto</p>
<p>Fiorentina: 1-Francesco Toldo, 2-Giulio Falcone, 3-Michele Serena, 14-Sandro Cois, 5-Lorenzo Amoruso, 19-Pasquale Padalino, 17-Pusceddu, 13-Anselmo Robbiati, 9-Gabriel Batistuta, 10-Rui Costa, 11-Oliveira</p>
</text>
